      "description": "from tenacity import RetryCallState, Retrying\nstate=RetryCallState(Retrying(),None,(),{})\nfrom tenacity import stop_after_delay\nstrategy=stop_after_delay(5)\nstate.start_time=100.0\nstate.outcome_timestamp=105.0\nprint('deadline_stop',strategy(state))\nassert strategy(state) is True\nstate.outcome_timestamp=104.0\nassert strategy(state) is False\nstate.outcome_timestamp=None\ntry:\n strategy(state)\n raise AssertionError('missing timestamp accepted')\nexcept RuntimeError:\n pass\n"
